# key kind. The key is path:name:digest, or path:block.member:digest for a block's member, the digest the first sixteen hex digits of BLAKE3 over the item's text with whitespace collapsed and comments and the attribute block left out; path:<file> for a source's head comment; path:comment:digest for an item comment, the digest over its text. The kind is uncommented, or unshaped:<rule> for a comment outside the shape (crates/surface-corpus/README.md § Comments)
